# Line endings: LF in the repo for everything text (2026-09-02 — a CRLF/LF
# mismatch between two checked-out files broke a byte-identity test on CI;
# Windows working copies still get CRLF via core.autocrlf where configured).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
